@startuml
title User Registration and Authentication Sequence

actor User
participant "Angular SPA" as SPA
participant "AuthController" as API

User -> SPA : Submit registration request
SPA -> API : POST /api/auth/register
activate API
API --> SPA : 200 OK (Auth register endpoint)
deactivate API

User -> SPA : Submit login request
SPA -> API : POST /api/auth/login
activate API
API --> SPA : 200 OK (Auth login endpoint)
deactivate API

@enduml
